# A polarised capacitor: the positive plate a hollow box, the negative a flat bar.
kind capacitor
convention A polarised capacitor: a hollow box for the positive plate (pin 1) and a flat bar for the negative.
check capacitor
pin + 0 -100
pin - 0 100
line 0 -100 0 -20
line 0 100 0 10
rect -40 -20 40 -10
line -40 10 40 10
